        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あたし、なんでこんなところに…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "沼地でアリシアって子に会って、家に案内してもらって、それで…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "そうだ、あの子はどこ！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "はぐれちゃったのかな…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "それに、ここは一体…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "とにかく、アリシアを探してこの場所から出ないと。"
      }
    ],
    "progression": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "それにしても広い廃墟だ…。焼け跡もあるし、火事でもあったのかな。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "もう外は真っ暗だし、あたしのランタンと壁の灯りだけが頼り…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ん？壁の灯り…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "廃墟のはずなのに、なんで灯りが付いてるの…？"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "何かが道を塞いでる…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あれは、ぬいぐるみ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "手に持ってるのは鎌…？なんだか悪趣味…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "なんかこっち見てるみたいで気味が悪いし、どかして先に進もう。"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation2": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "こいつ、魔物！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ぬいぐるみにしか見えなかった…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "もう、さっきからなんなのこの場所は！"
      }
    ],
    "resolution": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "なんとか倒したけど、こうして見るとやっぱりただのぬいぐるみに見える…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "倒したというか、動かなくなっただけというか…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "やっぱりおかしい…こいつ、戦ってる時もずっと魔力を感じなかった…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "じゃあこいつはなんで動き出して襲いかかってきたの…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ねえ、そこで何をやっているの？"
      }
    ],
    "resolution2": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "あら！シィルお姉さん！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "良かったわ。急にいなくなるから、探したのよ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "それはこっちのセリフだよ。っていうか、よく無事だったね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "うふふ。面白いことを言うわね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "え？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ここは私のお家なのだから、無事に決まっているでしょう？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……は？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "どうしたの？あなた、さっきまで私と一緒にお歌の練習をしていたでしょう？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "とっても楽しかったわよね！あなた、自分で下手と言っていたけれど、全然上手だったわ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……知らない。なにも覚えてない……！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "こんな気味の悪い廃墟が家だって言うの？あたしに何をするつもりだったの…！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "やっぱりなにも覚えていないのね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_4.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "あのハーピーがぜーんぶ台無しにしていったものね！",
        "sfx": "story_thunder",
        "flash": 0.3
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_4.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "せっかく二人で楽しくお歌を歌っていたのに、あの人ったら急に私に襲いかかって来たのよ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_5.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "もう少しでシィルお姉さんを完全に引き込むことができたのに。残念だわ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_5.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "さっきから何の話をしてるの…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_3.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ハーピーって逃げ足が速いのね。捕まえ損ねてしまったわ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "…え？このお屋敷からは出られないでしょうって？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "確かにそうね！それにあの人も正気を失いかけている状態だったわ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_5.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "うふふ、少し油断してしまったけれど、時間の問題ね！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ええ、そうよ？シィルお姉さんも今は少し正気を取り戻しただけ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_2.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "待っていてちょうだい。後で改めてみんなに紹介してあげるから！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "少女",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_4.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "あははははは！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_4.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（さっきから誰と話してるんだよ…！）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/gothic_girl_face_4.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（やばい、は、早くこの場所から逃げ出さないと！）"
      }
    ]
  },
